{"audio": "audio/gp02-puente-cien-anos-v2.mp3", "duracion": 52.349388, "escenas": [{"ini": 0.12, "fin": 3.5, "texto": "¿Cuánto dura un proyecto? Pocos meses, dirías tú.", "palabras": [{"w": "¿Cuánto", "ini": 0.12, "fin": 0.44}, {"w": "dura", "ini": 0.5, "fin": 0.72}, {"w": "un", "ini": 0.76, "fin": 0.84}, {"w": "proyecto?", "ini": 0.86, "fin": 1.36}, {"w": "Pocos", "ini": 2.26, "fin": 2.56}, {"w": "meses,", "ini": 2.62, "fin": 2.92}, {"w": "dirías", "ini": 2.98, "fin": 3.3}, {"w": "tú.", "ini": 3.36, "fin": 3.5}]}, {"ini": 4.28, "fin": 6.8, "texto": "Esta obra de un puente tardó cuatro años.", "palabras": [{"w": "Esta", "ini": 4.28, "fin": 4.52}, {"w": "obra", "ini": 4.62, "fin": 4.78}, {"w": "de", "ini": 4.82, "fin": 4.9}, {"w": "un", "ini": 4.96, "fin": 5.04}, {"w": "puente", "ini": 5.08, "fin": 5.44}, {"w": "tardó", "ini": 5.66, "fin": 6}, {"w": "cuatro", "ini": 6.08, "fin": 6.44}, {"w": "años.", "ini": 6.52, "fin": 6.8}]}, {"ini": 7.34, "fin": 9.16, "texto": "Y el puente va a durar cien.", "palabras": [{"w": "Y", "ini": 7.34, "fin": 7.38}, {"w": "el", "ini": 7.44, "fin": 7.54}, {"w": "puente", "ini": 7.6, "fin": 7.94}, {"w": "va", "ini": 8.16, "fin": 8.26}, {"w": "a", "ini": 8.28, "fin": 8.34}, {"w": "durar", "ini": 8.4, "fin": 8.72}, {"w": "cien.", "ini": 8.84, "fin": 9.16}]}, {"ini": 9.96, "fin": 15.16, "texto": "Las dos cosas son ciertas, porque el proyecto y lo que entrega no viven lo mismo.", "palabras": [{"w": "Las", "ini": 9.96, "fin": 10.12}, {"w": "dos", "ini": 10.18, "fin": 10.34}, {"w": "cosas", "ini": 10.42, "fin": 10.86}, {"w": "son", "ini": 10.94, "fin": 11.1}, {"w": "ciertas,", "ini": 11.16, "fin": 11.6}, {"w": "porque", "ini": 11.92, "fin": 12.14}, {"w": "el", "ini": 12.18, "fin": 12.26}, {"w": "proyecto", "ini": 12.3, "fin": 12.94}, {"w": "y", "ini": 13, "fin": 13.04}, {"w": "lo", "ini": 13.1, "fin": 13.18}, {"w": "que", "ini": 13.24, "fin": 13.32}, {"w": "entrega", "ini": 13.36, "fin": 13.86}, {"w": "no", "ini": 14.2, "fin": 14.32}, {"w": "vive